{"version":1,"content":"<p>國慶黃金周首日，天文台發出酷熱天氣警告，下午3時錄得33.4度。西貢方面，漁農自然護理署人員到場宣傳保護海洋生物，掛起寫有「海岸有生命——勿餵飼或觸碰海洋生物；保護珊瑚，勿踐踏」橫額，並不時作出廣播。橋咀洲浮潛區有獨木舟巡弋，提醒浮潛人士切勿站立，以免踩傷珊瑚。約中午12時，西貢氣溫達33.2度，廈門灣（又名半月灣）泳灘逼滿人。太陽傘租金約110元，罐裝可樂每罐16元仍被搶購一空。現場有一隻野豬出沒，有人正在餵飼，在場人士提醒餵飼者餵飼野豬可能被罰款，但對方似乎未能理解。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DJI_20261001145740_0175_D-2-1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"672\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_0147-1024x672.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"699\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_0154-1024x699.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"631\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_0042-1024x631.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"649\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_0039-1024x649.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_0110-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_0124-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_0060-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"702\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CW_00